<title>CANADA: Gentry to buy back 675,000 B shares.</title>
<headline>Gentry to buy back 675,000 B shares.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gentry Resources Ltd said on Wednesday it intends to make a normal course issuer bid to buy up to 675,000 of its class B shares, or less than five percent of its 13,510,964 outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The bid will commence September 27, 1996 and expire by September 26, 1997, Gentry said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
